# Imported module for the F1 redirect-resolution probe: `poke` is
# registered by the loader under its MANGLED name (mod_prefix + name),
# so the caller's CoW scan only finds its `&`-param signature after
# resolving call_redirects (the p1-R2 shape).
void poke(Vector[String] &v):
    v.set(0, "mutated")
